SUMMARY:Sign o’ the Times
DESCRIPTION:Experience the magic of Prince\, Sheila E\, Sheena Easton and more at this screening of Sign o’ the Times\, Prince’s 1987 concert film! Our brand-new\, state-of-the-art PK sound system will let you immerse yourself into the concert – almost as if you were really there. \nSign o’ the Times • PG-13 \nHighlights from Prince’s 1987 European concert tour\, including selections from the rock star’s album of the same title.
URL:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/events/275967-sign-o-the-times/
