SUMMARY:Club Curfew: The 90s – A Happy Hour Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a monthly Happy Hour dance party with DJ Gregarious where your night and your weekend starts EARLY! \nEach month is a different FUN theme with drink specials\, the most danceable-no-brainer-obvious hits\, and most importantly\, all your best requests (don’t worry\, I won’t play the lame ones) \n— \nOf course Club Curfew blasts off and goes Intergalactic with The 90’s.  \nIt pretty much cost $7 to go to a dance club back then (and your Lyft was pretty much YOUR MOM)! \nColor scheme: We pretty much recommend dressing in teal or purple (Sorry “Men in Black“).  Or… if you’re “Unbelievable” BOTH (OH!)
URL:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/events/276335-club-curfew-the-90s-a-happy-hour-dance-party/
CATEGORIES:May
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ClubCurfew26-3lYldm.jpg
END:VEVENT
