SUMMARY:Passport Prom
DESCRIPTION:Please note: This event is for McMenamins Passport holders. You must purchase a ticket and bring your McMenamins Passport in order to enter the venue. Don’t have a Passport yet? Start the Quest today!  \nDress to the nines\, grab your McMenamins Passport and get ready to trip the light fantastic at our Passport Prom! Whether you’re on your 12th Passport or are just getting started\, all Passport holders are invited to join us on the floating dance floor for a night of dancing and fun\, with cocktail specials & punch\, photo booth and royal court crowning ceremony. DJ Sonny Phono starts off the evening with party tunes\, and The Throwbacks kick it into high gear with rock\, pop and dance faves. \nBoth the Crystal Ballroom and Lola’s Room location stamps will be available during the prom. And of course\, it wouldn’t be a Passport Prom without a just-for-fun stamp!
URL:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/events/275994-passport-prom/
CATEGORIES:May
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Passport_Prom-iDdcjc.jpg
END:VEVENT
